OL,3,AJob vacancies fall as small firms cut
OL,4,Aback on recruitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe employment rate also rose slightly,
OL,7,Fand analysts said the jobs market was
OL,8,Fshowing signs of recovery despite the
OL,9,Fweakness in hiring.
